data: {"id": "e5eba24dca5b4430-final", "run_id": "e5eba24dca5b4430", "seq": 679, "ts_ms": 1789374153794, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v14/workload` | ContainerCreating | 目标节点 node2 的 /opt/cni/bin 路径下缺失 Pod 附加网络所需的 CNI 插件 'aiops-unavailable'，导致 Multus CNI 执行失败，无法创建 Pod Sandbox，从而使容器状态保持在 ContainerCreating。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedCreatePodSandBox ... Failed to create pod sandbox: rpc error: code = Unknown desc = failed to setup network for sandbox \"a2dd4c27504ff4dc1725009cd80c4198a6788079c9569c90df5c4e4e4d96e7f7\": plugin type=\"multus\" name=\"multus-cni-network\" failed (add): [aiops-case-v14/workload:secondary-net]: error adding container to network \"secondary-net\": failed to find plugin \"aiops-unavailable\" in path [/opt/cni/bin /opt/cni/bin]` (fact-5d3ecbf15700) | 提供直接因果证据，定位到 CNI 插件缺失导致网络初始化失败 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason: ContainerCreating` (fact-908ae0978e9c) | 描述当前阻碍业务容器运行的状态 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `Annotations: k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks: secondary-net` (fact-33a742eef458) | 说明 Pod 期望通过 Multus 配置附加网络，从而触发了对特定 CNI 插件的查找 |\n| 4 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.phase: Pending` (fact-4818da35b454) | 确认 Pod 卡在调度或初始化阶段，尚未进入运行状态 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"} = 1` (fact-0d74b14176e0) | 从监控层确认容器持续处于等待状态 |\n| 6 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total = 0` (fact-8734efdce74a) | 排除业务应用已崩溃重启的可能性，验证故障发生在启动前阶段 |\n\nK8s Event 明确给出了失败机制与具体错误信息（缺失 'aiops-unavailable' 插件），直接支撑了状态保持 `ContainerCreating` 和 `Pending` 的现象。Metric 的等待原因与重启数为零的数据，排除了应用层启动后崩溃的场景，将问题严格限定在 Kubelet 执行 CNI 插件调用的初始化阶段。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n节点 node2 的 CNI 插件路径下缺失 'aiops-unavailable' 插件 → Multus CNI 尝试为 secondary-net 附加网络时执行失败 → Kubelet 创建 Pod Sandbox 流程因网络初始化报错中断 → Pod 容器状态卡在 ContainerCreating\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为：目标节点 node2 的 `/opt/cni/bin` 路径下缺少名为 `aiops-unavailable` 的 CNI 插件。\n\n具体而言，Pod `aiops-case-v14/workload` 配置了附加网络 `secondary-net`，在调度至 node2 后，Kubelet 调用 Multus CNI 进行网络配置，但在指定路径下未能找到该插件文件（见证据表 #1，fact-5d3ecbf15700）。这一缺失导致网络设置失败，进而使 Pod Sandbox 无法创建，容器一直处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态等待中（见证据表 #2，fact-908ae0978e9c）。\n\n目前证据不足以判断该插件应当是“被意外删除/未部署”，还是“Pod YAML 配置中错误引用了不存在的插件名称”。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 12.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 41.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v14/workload: 41.4s (Evidence 33.7s, RCA 7.6s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 12.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v14/workload**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 66.217, "metrics": {"run_id": "e5eba24dca5b4430", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 66.23159265518188, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.9, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 66231.59265518188, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 62497.16353416443, "tool_calls": 16, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 15, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 11623.114109039307, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3357.626438140869}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 12316.59722328186, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 41394.31118965149, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 12489.55488204956, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

